  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in an earthenware bowl over medium heat.",
    "Sauté chopped onion and garlic until softened.",
    "Add sliced jalapeño peppers and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add trimmed morning-glory-pak-bung and cook until lightly browned.",
    "Add white wine, chicken broth, tomato paste, and thyme. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring to a boil, then cover and transfer to the oven at 300°F (150°C) for 25 minutes.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
